From b1b6067a46ae2c8f7fdb20a1286587a7ef276262 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <EscapeA@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 17:05:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): use latest API prompt_tokens for context usage UI

Wire bridge model.usage prompt_tokens (log "in=") into session.contextTokens
so ChatInput shows real provider-reported context occupancy instead of the
local message/fixed estimate. Prefer the latest non-estimated prompt_tokens
per run, skip final local estimate overwrite while that value is known, and
clear it after compression so post-compact local estimates can resume until
the next real API usage event.
---
